WEBVTT

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:48.500
What a haul!
What a haul!

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.830
Over there!

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:35.180
A brassiere!
A brassiere!

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:46.180
You pervert!

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:47.290
How disgusting!

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:49.190
Stop him!

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:50.790
NO!

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:56.060
So, sweet things, you all
want to come with me?

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:05.330
Who's there?

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:12.980
There you are!

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:26.830
My panties!

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:03.770
Bingo!

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:06.500
Huh?
Where could it be?

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.970
Odd.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:17.440
How sweet!
And unprotected, too!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.610
I'll take you all
someplace much safer!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.750
Huh? I can't
seem to move forward.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.730
Whaddya think you're doin',
you old letch!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.060
I... Uh... I just dropped something!

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:36.000
What was that?
You dropped something?

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:38.040
Ranma!
It's been a while!

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:41.630
If you want some
panties too, I can share!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.370
No!

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:46.410
Let's make a deal.
I'll give you Akane's panties. You want 'em?

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.610
Who would want a pair
of that tomboy's panties?

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.910
Who's a tomboy?

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.990
I expected this
from Happosai...

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.520
but now you're trying
to steal my panties!

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:01.330
You...

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.760
shameless jerk!

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.130
What'd you do that for?

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.870
Why can't you just
listen to me once!?

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:18.870
I was just tryin' to
protect your pant... Huh?

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:21.500
So, you've finally
shown your true self!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.280
I don't need to
listen to you!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.480
You freaky old goat!

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:31.150
Come back, pervert!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.590
Hold it, Ranma!

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:36.090
Don't they ever get
tired of fighting?

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:38.320
Everyone, time for lunch!

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:45.560
Come get your laundry rods!

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.440
Where am I?

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.680
Here I am being chased
by two gorgeous girls!

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:59.340
I'm such a gigolo!

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:03.420
Quit runnin' all over the place!
Give it up!

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.680
You give it up!

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:10.500
Both of you, come back here!

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:14.660
Akane, no matter where I go,
I imagine I can hear you.

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:15.930
Get back here, old man!

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:17.230
I don't think so!

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.310
"I don't think so"?

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:35.440
That was Ranma and Happosai,
I'm sure of it!

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.790
How dare they mock me,
Ryoga Hibiki!

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:40.480
I can't forgive this!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:41.890
Wait up!

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.430
Oh, Ryoga!
I'm sorry!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:50.560
She was in such a hurry!
They must have done something to her!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.400
I must protect her from
those villains' evil clutches!

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:16.200
C'mon, old man!
Get back here!

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:19.930
How about this?

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.370
It's the only way to fly!

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.210
He's a freak!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.950
Nihao, Ranma!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.650
Weather so beautiful! Perfect
for date with Shampoo!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.720
It's dangerous to
ride your bike up here!

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.920
Never mind details!
We go on date!

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:49.690
HOT!

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:53.290
I ain't cup o' noodles,
you know!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.300
What do you think
you're doing?

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.740
Hold it!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.740
Why does this
always happen to me?

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:09.210
Pigtailed girl!
Fly into my arms!

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:10.510
You wanna fly?

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.720
Today, love is more
painful than customary.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:18.120
Perhaps the heights of my pain
express the depths of her love.

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:20.390
I comprehend your girlish heart well!
Let's begin our romance!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.990
Our love will break the
boundaries of Hell itself!

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.420
Wait up!

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:33.070
Ranma has just passed
the entrance, Shampoo!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:36.340
True! That was
my future son-in-law.

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:39.740
Shampoo was with him.
I wonder what the fuss is?

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.880
It's mackerel jerky.

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:53.960
What does he intend to do
with Shampoo, my future bride?

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:57.390
Ranma Saotome!
Prepare to die!

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:01.790
I don't know what's going on,
but it looks interesting!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:09.830
Wait!

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:14.010
What?
What's everybody doing?

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:16.540
Blitzkrieg!

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:21.280
It's been so long, Ukyo!

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.720
How dare you
impersonate my sign!

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:26.790
Farewell!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.960
Won't that fool
ever give up?

00:08:29.930 --> 00:08:33.160
Oh, no! I can't run my
restaurant without my curtain!

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:34.760
Wait up!

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:45.180
Once again, the pigtailed girl
enters my life.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.450
Ah, those bittersweet memories!

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:53.980
Charlotte! Charlotte!
San-chan, let's run after them!

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.350
Here we go!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.320
Hold on, Azusa!

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.090
Charlotte!

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.390
Let go of me, you airhead!

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.890
Stop, thief!

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:34.020
Send the bill to Ranma Saotome,
care of the Tendo Dojo!

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:43.270
I've had my morning snack,
now I'll have to go back for lunch!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.700
Long time no see, Ranma!

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.710
What is this?
A marathon?

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:57.510
Who do you think is the cause
of all this, you old moron!

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:07.490
At last, I found you, Happosai.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:21.540
Hey, old fart!
You're the master! Do somethin'!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:26.110
Fool! As my disciple you should
sacrifice yourself for me!

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:29.810
This is all your fault, Ranma!
You never change!

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:32.040
You just don't ever listen to me!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.750
What's that? You want to
make up another excuse?

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:37.520
And what about all your flirting
with Shampoo?

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:42.630
Jeez! If you're goin' to be jealous,
why can't you be cuter?

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:46.400
You think that kind of talk
will shut a girl up? Dream on!

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:49.630
What girl?
I'm far sexier than you!

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:52.170
What did you say?
Do you mind repeating that?

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:54.300
As many times as you like!
You're uncute! A tomboy!

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:56.910
Always raggin'! Clumsy!
Waistless! A gorilla...

00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.280
What was that?

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.150
- Here I go!
- My curtain!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.750
How cute!
Josephine!

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:11.320
What are you thinking?

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:30.030
Kasumi, your cooking
is always delicious!

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:32.270
You flatter me, Mr. Saotome.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:35.070
Saotome, compliments
won't get you seconds.

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:38.210
And leave some
pickled veggies for me!

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:41.380
I wonder when Akane and
the others will return?

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:46.650
This always happens!
They'll be back when they smell the curry!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:50.900
And they're back,
even as we speak.

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.500
Hot!

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:05.040
So much for my quiet weekend!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:09.570
Ranma! Akane!
Sit down and explain this!

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:12.480
What's to explain?
That says it all!

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.490
W-What?

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:23.490
An elephant?

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.360
My, how cute!

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.400
That is no ordinary elephant!

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.200
It has an incredible battle aura!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:34.300
What we thought was its body
was actually its aura!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.610
What do you think you're doing?

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:40.970
What?

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.840
Akane! Are you unharmed?

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:19.480
A girl elephant trainer?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:23.450
Well done.
Good girl, Jasmine.

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:29.290
I've been looking for you, Happosai!

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:31.120
You were responsible!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.320
W-What is this?
A scroll?

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:41.500
This Scroll of Luck has been
passed down for generations!

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:45.770
Happosai, because of you, I... I...

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:49.310
Give me back my carefree youth!

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.130
What? What is that?

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:05.290
Live long enough and
you see everything!

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:07.660
Will you listen to me?

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:16.700
Just who are you?

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:21.810
I am the master of
the unbeatable martial arts school:

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:26.390
Seven Lucky Gods Martial Arts!
I am Kirin!

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:30.050
My prince!

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:34.990
I've finally found you!
The one foretold in prophecy.

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:39.090
The woman chosen by
the Seven Lucky Gods! Come!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.600
My prince!

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:44.630
My prince!

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.170
Who are you?

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:52.070
I have no use for you.
You do not possess the scroll.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:59.180
Hey, Akane.
Isn't that the scroll in question?

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:02.120
Ebiten!

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:06.320
Use a shrimp to
catch the finest fish!

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:13.530
Akane!

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:14.630
Akane!

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.830
Akane!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.500
You jerk!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:25.870
Akane!

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.340
Ranma!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:31.570
You creep!
What are you doin' with Akane?

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:35.010
What?

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:40.990
Do not presume to board
my ship uninvited!

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:43.060
You shall learn
your lesson through pain!

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:48.190
Seven Gods School Secret Attack:
Hundred Chopstick Sting!

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:52.830
Ranma!

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.460
- Ranma!
- Ranma!

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:58.740
A-ka-ne!

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:04.550
The scrolls of the Ultimate Technique
are now assembled!

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:06.910
Finally, the world belongs
to the two of us!

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:07.710
Hey!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.420
What the heck are
you talking about?

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:14.120
This fight is far from over!

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:17.700
Ranma! How dare you
treat me like a doormat!

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:22.030
Akane!

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:23.900
Akane!

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.970
Ranma!

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.250
My prince!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:40.550
My prince!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:51.330
Sparkle, sparkle.
The sun is setting.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:56.090
Sparkle, sparkle.
The sun goes down.

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:59.400
Is all better now, right? Ranma?

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:00.760
Ranma?

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:06.080
Damn! Just who was that guy?

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:09.410
I wonder! He mentioned
something about a technique...

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:12.620
Old man.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:18.620
You know something about that scroll
the elephant girl threw.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:20.660
Gee, what could
you be talking about?

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:24.160
Don't play dumb!
It's written all over your face!

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:28.700
The Seven Lucky Gods are fabled
warriors from China's interior.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:34.900
A region called Nekonron.
But why would they come to Japan?

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.570
I can't hide anything
with Cologne here.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:40.410
What do you know, old man?

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:41.950
Master!

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:46.150
I'll have to talk. It was
back when I was only eighteen.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:50.310
I was traveling through China,
training my Kenpo skills.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:55.520
At one point, I came across
a strange procession.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:09.270
Poor thing. It's her turn now.

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:12.680
She's to be sacrificed to
complete the scroll's secret.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:16.040
The Seven Lucky Gods
can be so cruel!

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:19.850
They only want the Ultimate Technique
to rule the world!

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:21.080
Those bastards!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:26.420
I can't allow a young girl. to
be sacrificed to somebody's whims!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.120
Incredible!

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:31.420
So these Seven Lucky Gods
are warriors in name only!

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:34.430
In truth, world conquest is the goal
of their secret organization!

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:35.530
Exactly!

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:40.610
I had to steal the scroll
for the sake of world peace!

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:02.090
I managed to get to shore,
but there my strength gave out.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.490
What's wrong, Jasmine?

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:09.200
And that was how
I met the young girl.

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:13.600
Take this...
For world peace!

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:19.370
She was a nice, obedient girl!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:24.650
And now, she's become such a
twisted wretch. As time goes by...

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.220
Are you listening to me?

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.380
I was listening.

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:30.050
That's my Nabiki!

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:35.220
Basically, Akane was kidnapped
because you stole the scroll.

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:38.330
So Akane's gonna be
some sort of sacrifice?

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:43.760
Right! Then I'm
going to Nekonron!

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:45.700
You can't go alone, Ryoga!

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:50.340
It'd take you years to
get to China by yourself.

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:52.100
I'll go, too.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.710
I still have a score to
settle with that jerk Kirin.

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.820
If Ranma go to China,
Shampoo go, too!

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:58.470
Is okay, Great-grandmother?

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:00.540
Going back home after so long?

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:03.180
If Shampoo goes,
I shall go as well!

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:08.760
That's true friendship! Thank you, Ranma!
Thank you, everyone!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:13.560
Akane is blessed with
such friends as these!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.860
You sluggards!

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:21.100
We'll go!
Just stay back!

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:24.840
Right! It's decided!
We're all goin'!

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:26.950
To Nekonron to finish off
these Seven Lucky Gods!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:32.710
Wonderful! But how do
you plan to get there?

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:35.390
I-I dunno...

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:38.580
As for that...

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:41.260
Leave the details to me,
Tatewaki Kuno!

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:42.830
Hey, Kuno-baby.
The door!?

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.330
Be silent!

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:49.800
Use the Kuno Family Secret for
the jaunt to China: Subdragon 5.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:51.490
Kuno!

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.530
Even you have your good points!

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:58.270
This is but a fraction
of the vast Kuno estate!

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:01.240
Now, my minions!
To China!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.750
Subdragon 5

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:15.960
Onward! Row!
Forward! Let's go!

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:19.500
Aw, man! I knew
this was gonna happen!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.330
Can we really get
to China in this?

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:27.340
Oh, Akane! How is the poor child faring?
I so long to see her!

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:31.910
Hey, gramps.
What's that in your hand?

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:33.610
I-It's dear Akane's bra!

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:38.710
You old letch! Whose fault
do you think this is!?

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:41.390
Hey, Ryoga!
Quit rocking the boat!

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:45.420
No! Not until the old goat is
feeding the Pacific fishes!

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:48.030
Wrong!
This Sea of Japan!

00:21:48.190 --> 00:21:52.390
I'm telling you to stop,
the boat's gonna capsize...

00:21:56.770 --> 00:21:59.000
I knew this was gonna happen!

00:21:59.140 --> 00:22:00.970
It's the only way to sail!

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:02.470
Is this the best you can do?

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:11.010
We're saved!

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.590
Ahoy! People overboard!

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:32.330
I, Ebiten, head disciple of
the Seven Lucky Gods School...

00:22:32.470 --> 00:22:35.340
have brought the
woman as ordered!

00:22:35.640 --> 00:22:36.700
Well done.

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:40.970
You sure go overboard
for a simple kidnapping!

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:41.810
Watch your language!

00:22:41.950 --> 00:22:46.280
Why don't you just tell me
what you intend to do with me?

00:22:46.650 --> 00:22:50.850
Stop that, woman! You mustn't
talk to Master Kirin that way!

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:52.910
No matter, Ebiten.

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:59.690
This young lady will
become my blushing bride.

00:23:00.130 --> 00:23:02.100
B-Blushing bride!?

00:23:02.840 --> 00:23:03.560
Correct!

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:08.500
By Nekonron law, the bearers of
the scroll halves must marry.

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:11.410
This is the half
that Master Kirin bears.

00:23:11.510 --> 00:23:15.970
Shall we begin the first step
of our new lives together?

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:19.080
That's what I'm
supposed to say, right?

00:23:19.220 --> 00:23:20.780
Exactly, Sire!

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:25.120
What kind of nonsense
are you spouting?

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:37.170
Master Kirin!

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:44.670
What have you done?

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:48.370
I guess I hit him
a little too hard.

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:51.880
Woman! Your attack on the
Master will not be tolerated!

00:23:52.020 --> 00:23:53.710
Hold, Bishamonten!

00:24:01.660 --> 00:24:02.690
Oww!

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:04.830
Hey, wait a sec!

00:24:07.030 --> 00:24:08.360
C'mon!

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:12.700
What is this?
It's like a storage shed!

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:24.870
Rice and pickles!?

00:24:26.250 --> 00:24:29.310
Is this any way
to treat a bride?!

00:24:38.030 --> 00:24:39.560
Ranma...

00:25:03.590 --> 00:25:04.560
Aw, man!

00:25:04.990 --> 00:25:06.860
Pigtailed girl!

00:25:09.760 --> 00:25:11.560
A Cat!

00:25:20.610 --> 00:25:22.840
Why can't you just let us
on the stupid boat!

00:25:23.280 --> 00:25:24.680
Pigtailed girl...

00:25:24.810 --> 00:25:27.940
You have to rescue people
stranded at sea! It's the rules!

00:25:30.720 --> 00:25:32.480
Shut up!

00:25:33.150 --> 00:25:35.920
You stole my prince from me!

00:25:36.090 --> 00:25:39.220
You have no right to
get on board my ship!

00:25:39.460 --> 00:25:40.720
Of course not!

00:25:41.090 --> 00:25:46.000
Leave those fools behind,
and we'll live happily ever after.

00:25:46.970 --> 00:25:50.230
It was you who ruined my life!
Get him, Jasmine!

00:25:52.840 --> 00:25:55.600
Lychee, darling!

00:25:56.280 --> 00:25:59.730
I've searched so long for my prince
through many hardships!

00:25:59.880 --> 00:26:04.780
And the moment I find him,
like some ironic twist of fate...

00:26:05.490 --> 00:26:08.550
he's suddenly
wrenched from me!

00:26:11.090 --> 00:26:13.960
Can anyone know the unhappiness
I have known?

00:26:20.070 --> 00:26:22.560
Are you listening to me?!

00:26:23.840 --> 00:26:24.500
Oww!

00:26:28.040 --> 00:26:30.510
What did I do to deserve this?

00:26:31.380 --> 00:26:35.070
Now, let's have some real fun!

00:26:36.480 --> 00:26:37.240
Jasmine!

00:26:39.020 --> 00:26:40.450
- That's it!
- Go for it!

00:26:43.920 --> 00:26:47.950
Is this respect
for your master?!

00:26:53.500 --> 00:26:56.940
At this rate,
the ship is going to sink!

00:26:58.200 --> 00:27:00.200
This is all your fault!

00:27:00.710 --> 00:27:04.340
Will you people do
something about this?

00:27:17.090 --> 00:27:19.560
But why must
I man the oars?!

00:27:19.730 --> 00:27:23.560
I pulled your drowned carcass
from the sea, that's why!

00:27:26.270 --> 00:27:27.990
Is the hole plugged?

00:27:28.130 --> 00:27:30.300
Sure!
Taken care of!

00:27:32.710 --> 00:27:34.540
The water's stopped up tight now.

00:27:34.670 --> 00:27:37.730
So, why did you come to
the Tendos' house, anyway?

00:27:38.880 --> 00:27:40.240
What'd you do that for!?

00:27:41.110 --> 00:27:44.310
Will you listen
to all my hardships?

00:27:45.120 --> 00:27:45.950
Be my guest.

00:27:46.550 --> 00:27:49.320
It started when I was six years old...

00:27:58.200 --> 00:27:59.060
Well?

00:27:59.200 --> 00:28:04.000
Have you assented to be my bride,
as our laws say you must?

00:28:05.240 --> 00:28:08.210
First, tell me
what the heck this is.

00:28:09.010 --> 00:28:10.840
It's breakfast.

00:28:17.450 --> 00:28:19.320
What is it?
Won't you eat?

00:28:19.450 --> 00:28:22.390
No.
I've lost my appetite.

00:28:22.790 --> 00:28:25.990
We can't have that!
Someone bring a digestive!

00:28:26.130 --> 00:28:28.150
It's not that
I'm not hungry!

00:28:29.000 --> 00:28:33.130
How can you stand having rice
and pickled veggies every day?!

00:28:34.230 --> 00:28:38.140
But yesterday we ate pickled
cucumbers and Chinese cabbage!

00:28:38.470 --> 00:28:41.530
No! That's not
what I meant!

00:28:41.770 --> 00:28:43.800
I want to know if you have any
other kinds of food here!?

00:28:43.940 --> 00:28:48.850
Then what would you like?
Pickled turnips? Pickled greens?

00:28:48.980 --> 00:28:51.040
Pickled pearl onions, perhaps?

00:28:51.180 --> 00:28:53.550
Don't you understand?

00:28:53.720 --> 00:28:56.810
Stuff like hamburger,
or pigs in a blanket?

00:28:56.990 --> 00:28:58.620
What!?

00:28:58.790 --> 00:29:01.490
You cook
pigs in bedding!?

00:29:01.630 --> 00:29:06.030
Nekonron's custom is to eat rice
and pickled vegetables only!

00:29:06.170 --> 00:29:08.760
You are to wed Master Kirin!

00:29:08.900 --> 00:29:12.670
So you must get accustomed
to Nekonron's eating habits.

00:29:16.540 --> 00:29:19.270
W-What kind of
reaction is that!?

00:29:19.710 --> 00:29:22.200
She is a fussy woman...

00:29:22.350 --> 00:29:26.610
You have to be kidding! Rice
and pickles every day!

00:29:32.390 --> 00:29:36.290
Okay, so you've been traveling
with that Scroll of Luck...

00:29:36.430 --> 00:29:39.660
hoping that some prince would
carry you off on his white horse.

00:29:39.800 --> 00:29:41.430
And you've been doing
this for ten years?

00:29:41.570 --> 00:29:44.400
Yes, but only tragedy follows me!

00:29:44.540 --> 00:29:47.300
First house burn down,
then evil pirates attack.

00:29:47.440 --> 00:29:50.310
How'd you get the scroll
in the first place?

00:29:50.440 --> 00:29:54.310
My grandmother got it
from a man called Happosai.

00:29:54.450 --> 00:29:58.080
So you came to Japan
to find the old goat.

00:29:59.350 --> 00:30:00.280
Hey, look!

00:30:00.420 --> 00:30:01.580
Traveling acrobats!

00:30:03.760 --> 00:30:07.890
Why name a scroll of secret
techniques "The Scroll of Luck"?

00:30:07.960 --> 00:30:11.050
Why are you asking me, Saotome?
I wouldn't know.

00:30:11.130 --> 00:30:14.290
I figure the old man probably
jumped a restaurant bill...

00:30:14.430 --> 00:30:18.890
gave 'em the scroll sayin', "Keep
this, and your prince will come."

00:30:19.040 --> 00:30:21.370
then he ran for it.

00:30:21.510 --> 00:30:24.370
That's right! Our family has
always run a restaurant!

00:30:24.510 --> 00:30:28.810
Why dwell on the past?
Now that Lychee has forgiven me...

00:30:28.950 --> 00:30:30.140
Who's forgiven you?!

00:31:24.770 --> 00:31:26.030
That was really scary!

00:31:33.810 --> 00:31:36.300
I knew this would be the room!

00:31:43.560 --> 00:31:44.990
That stinks!

00:32:04.780 --> 00:32:06.440
Quit rockin' the boat!

00:32:06.580 --> 00:32:08.010
What's wrong, Jasmine?!

00:32:10.220 --> 00:32:10.840
That's...

00:32:17.790 --> 00:32:20.190
What is the meaning of this?
It's the middle of the night!

00:32:20.330 --> 00:32:21.550
Master Kirin!

00:32:22.160 --> 00:32:23.490
Akane, those vats are...

00:32:23.630 --> 00:32:27.830
Stay back! One step closer,
and I pull the switch!

00:32:28.430 --> 00:32:29.420
No, don't!

00:32:29.570 --> 00:32:32.200
If you do that, the bottom
of the ship will open...

00:32:32.340 --> 00:32:34.500
and all the pickled
vegetables will fall!

00:32:35.010 --> 00:32:38.600
Why!? Do you not wish
to become my bride?!

00:32:38.840 --> 00:32:40.440
It's not that I don't like you...

00:32:40.580 --> 00:32:43.410
I just can't stand
your people's eating habits!

00:32:43.550 --> 00:32:45.710
Stop!

00:32:46.590 --> 00:32:49.320
Remove your hand
from the switch!

00:32:49.490 --> 00:32:54.720
Stop this foolishness!
Should we only eat rice from now on?!

00:32:54.790 --> 00:32:56.060
Don't you understand anything?

00:32:56.600 --> 00:33:00.400
I'm saying you should
eat something different!

00:33:09.310 --> 00:33:10.830
Help yourself!

00:33:11.180 --> 00:33:12.470
W-What is this?

00:33:12.610 --> 00:33:16.050
It's my home cooking!
Go on, have some!

00:33:18.550 --> 00:33:20.380
Are you going to eat it or not!?

00:33:20.520 --> 00:33:21.490
Very well.

00:33:21.620 --> 00:33:22.480
Master Kirin!

00:33:22.660 --> 00:33:24.020
Stay back!

00:34:09.600 --> 00:34:13.130
I-Incredible!
This is "home cooking"!?

00:34:13.270 --> 00:34:17.540
This is what food other than
pickled vegetables tastes like!?

00:34:17.680 --> 00:34:20.080
You understand now, right?

00:34:20.210 --> 00:34:23.940
The world has lots of delicious
food. Not just pickles!

00:34:27.690 --> 00:34:29.420
H-Hey!
What's wrong!?

00:34:29.590 --> 00:34:30.180
Master Kirin!

00:34:31.720 --> 00:34:33.780
P-Pickles!!

00:34:35.230 --> 00:34:36.560
Pickles?

00:34:36.700 --> 00:34:38.560
What have you
done to him!?

00:34:38.700 --> 00:34:41.500
How could you give Master
Kirin something like that?

00:34:41.630 --> 00:34:44.030
That's rude! I was just
giving him a home-cooked meal!

00:34:44.170 --> 00:34:45.530
That's the problem!

00:34:45.670 --> 00:34:50.630
Our people's bodies can't take
anything but rice and pickles!

00:34:51.310 --> 00:34:52.110
But...

00:34:52.240 --> 00:34:54.410
P-P-Pickles!

00:34:57.550 --> 00:34:58.910
Hold on a second!

00:34:59.920 --> 00:35:02.820
P-Pickles!
M-Must have pickles!

00:35:04.360 --> 00:35:05.790
Master Kirin!

00:35:12.300 --> 00:35:13.960
This'll do, right?

00:35:14.430 --> 00:35:15.330
Akane!

00:35:18.370 --> 00:35:19.460
Return the switch!

00:35:19.710 --> 00:35:20.470
Sire!

00:35:22.610 --> 00:35:24.370
Akane!

00:35:25.580 --> 00:35:26.240
Hold on!

00:35:28.050 --> 00:35:28.950
Master Kirin!

00:35:33.590 --> 00:35:35.820
Hurry, or we'll lose them!

00:35:36.920 --> 00:35:38.480
Old man!
Help us out!

00:35:38.660 --> 00:35:39.350
Look up!

00:35:43.300 --> 00:35:44.730
- Akane!
- Akane!

00:35:44.900 --> 00:35:46.230
Akane Tendo!

00:35:49.000 --> 00:35:49.930
Akane!

00:35:50.470 --> 00:35:51.400
My prince!

00:36:04.220 --> 00:36:06.380
My prince!
Hang in there!

00:36:08.690 --> 00:36:09.650
Akane!

00:36:09.820 --> 00:36:10.950
Pigtailed girl!

00:36:11.120 --> 00:36:12.890
Ranma!

00:36:13.030 --> 00:36:15.190
Master Kirin!

00:36:16.800 --> 00:36:18.960
C-Can't breathe!

00:36:22.770 --> 00:36:24.700
A-Akane!

00:36:24.840 --> 00:36:29.500
Disaster! Both my loved ones
kidnapped in one fell swoop!

00:36:34.150 --> 00:36:39.140
Akane! Lychee! Ranma!

00:36:39.250 --> 00:36:41.410
I wanna come, too!

00:36:44.090 --> 00:36:47.060
You want to go with them, Master?

00:36:50.300 --> 00:36:52.700
- Master Kirin!
- Master Kirin!

00:36:53.970 --> 00:36:57.830
Odd. It seems the number
of brides has increased.

00:36:58.640 --> 00:37:00.000
After them!

00:37:07.550 --> 00:37:08.380
What was that?!

00:37:08.980 --> 00:37:11.140
Intruders! Let's go!

00:37:11.820 --> 00:37:14.550
Hey! Let us outta here first!

00:37:19.360 --> 00:37:22.590
Ingrates! Just who do
they think the Master is?

00:37:22.730 --> 00:37:25.820
That's right!
Lychee! Akane!

00:37:26.570 --> 00:37:28.590
Ranma!

00:37:46.120 --> 00:37:48.350
Pretty lady!

00:37:48.420 --> 00:37:50.290
L-La-Lady!

00:37:57.200 --> 00:37:58.750
You give back Ranma!

00:37:59.260 --> 00:38:01.230
And Akane Tendo and the
pigtailed girl as well!

00:38:01.300 --> 00:38:02.670
Oww! Oww! Oww!

00:38:02.800 --> 00:38:06.760
If you want your friends back,
you'll have to defeat us first!

00:38:06.910 --> 00:38:08.630
Let's go!

00:38:09.710 --> 00:38:11.340
You okay, Akane?

00:38:11.480 --> 00:38:12.940
Ranma!

00:38:15.080 --> 00:38:16.910
My prince...

00:38:30.900 --> 00:38:32.060
What the?!

00:38:32.660 --> 00:38:33.690
M-My prince...

00:38:33.830 --> 00:38:34.920
H-Hey!

00:38:35.070 --> 00:38:37.660
Hmm! So that's how it is!

00:38:37.800 --> 00:38:39.330
I get it!

00:38:39.470 --> 00:38:42.960
You should talk, with
what you're doin'!

00:38:48.210 --> 00:38:51.440
I look away for a second,
and your taste in men gets worse!

00:38:51.880 --> 00:38:56.250
This man ate my cooking!
He said it was good!

00:38:56.920 --> 00:38:59.820
So that's why he looks half-dead.

00:38:59.960 --> 00:39:03.220
What!? Would you
care to repeat that?

00:39:06.670 --> 00:39:07.960
My prince!

00:39:08.100 --> 00:39:09.800
My prince,
hang in there!

00:39:09.940 --> 00:39:11.370
What're you doing!?

00:39:11.500 --> 00:39:14.300
This is the half-dead moron's fiancée.

00:39:15.510 --> 00:39:19.710
And you were having so much fun.
Too bad!

00:39:22.980 --> 00:39:25.140
That hurt!

00:39:27.750 --> 00:39:28.690
Ouchie!

00:39:28.850 --> 00:39:30.120
Whaddya think you're doin'!?

00:39:44.000 --> 00:39:45.870
W-What-happened-to-me!?

00:39:46.000 --> 00:39:47.300
My prince!

00:39:47.540 --> 00:39:48.510
Who are you?

00:39:48.640 --> 00:39:50.840
I'm the original bearer of the scroll!

00:39:50.980 --> 00:39:53.570
I'm the one to be your bride!

00:39:54.580 --> 00:39:58.640
I don't know you.
The only bride for me is Akane!

00:39:58.780 --> 00:39:59.720
B-Bride!?

00:40:01.420 --> 00:40:02.750
But...

00:40:04.020 --> 00:40:07.250
H-Hey!
What d'you mean by bride?!

00:40:07.390 --> 00:40:09.990
Bride, noun: A woman just
married or about to be married.

00:40:10.060 --> 00:40:14.060
Woman with whom one spends
one's life. Mate: See wife.

00:40:14.200 --> 00:40:15.960
That's not what I meant!

00:40:16.100 --> 00:40:18.900
I'll never let you
make Akane your bride!

00:40:20.370 --> 00:40:21.240
What?

00:40:22.910 --> 00:40:23.880
Ranma!

00:40:25.480 --> 00:40:28.170
I have no need
of your permission!

00:40:28.780 --> 00:40:30.770
She's my fiancée!

00:40:34.890 --> 00:40:36.410
F-Fiancée?

00:40:37.590 --> 00:40:38.490
You lie.

00:40:38.620 --> 00:40:39.920
Why's that a lie?

00:40:40.060 --> 00:40:42.930
Aren't you a woman?

00:40:48.230 --> 00:40:49.700
I forgot!

00:40:51.970 --> 00:40:52.870
You dolt.

00:40:53.370 --> 00:40:57.670
Anyway! I'll never let
you take Akane away!

00:40:59.750 --> 00:41:01.270
If you take her...

00:41:01.410 --> 00:41:02.940
If I take her?

00:41:03.680 --> 00:41:05.910
All of you will...

00:41:06.050 --> 00:41:08.210
All of us will?

00:41:12.060 --> 00:41:16.150
Die from Akane's cooking!

00:41:19.300 --> 00:41:21.990
Ranma, you jerk!

00:41:29.470 --> 00:41:30.240
Cast off!

00:41:33.050 --> 00:41:33.980
Master Kirin!

00:41:35.610 --> 00:41:36.880
I've got you now!

00:41:44.760 --> 00:41:46.750
It's about time...

00:41:48.330 --> 00:41:50.230
to end this.

00:41:57.370 --> 00:41:58.340
Shampoo!

00:42:08.580 --> 00:42:10.010
This looks bad!

00:42:12.650 --> 00:42:13.740
Ranma!

00:42:14.520 --> 00:42:16.380
Drop the interlopers
into the sea!

00:42:16.560 --> 00:42:17.580
My prince!

00:42:36.040 --> 00:42:37.170
Come, Akane.

00:42:41.150 --> 00:42:42.810
Are you all right!?
Hang in there!

00:42:42.950 --> 00:42:43.780
Master Kirin!

00:42:51.960 --> 00:42:53.620
Don't let go!

00:42:54.930 --> 00:42:56.360
Aww, man!

00:43:14.510 --> 00:43:18.510
I'm so sorry.
I forced my cooking on you.

00:43:19.080 --> 00:43:21.850
No, it's not your fault.
Don't let it worry you.

00:43:22.520 --> 00:43:25.750
It is my fault!
What should I say?

00:43:26.460 --> 00:43:30.660
Pickled vegetables all the time
must be so boring.

00:43:31.230 --> 00:43:33.660
I thought you'd want
something different.

00:43:35.000 --> 00:43:38.870
But I was only looking at it
from my own viewpoint.

00:43:39.370 --> 00:43:42.100
And I'm not a very good cook.

00:43:43.680 --> 00:43:45.400
Please forgive me.

00:43:54.590 --> 00:43:57.020
Don't let it trouble you.

00:43:58.520 --> 00:44:01.460
The mistakes of the past
are behind us.

00:44:01.630 --> 00:44:06.290
You tried to dump the vats,
and made me "home cooking"...

00:44:06.870 --> 00:44:09.930
It was all for my sake.

00:44:11.470 --> 00:44:12.440
Kirin...

00:44:13.040 --> 00:44:14.560
You've pleased me greatly.

00:44:14.710 --> 00:44:19.440
Since my birth, I was reared
to lead the Seven Lucky Gods.

00:44:20.480 --> 00:44:23.610
But no one has cared
for me so much as you.

00:44:29.860 --> 00:44:31.480
Become my bride!

00:44:45.270 --> 00:44:46.000
Akane!

00:44:48.440 --> 00:44:49.700
Forgive me...

00:44:49.840 --> 00:44:50.640
But I...

00:44:51.510 --> 00:44:57.540
Are you thinking of that man
you called for, back in Japan?

00:44:59.920 --> 00:45:01.040
That man?

00:45:01.620 --> 00:45:07.290
The man I defeated!?
You're saying you love this "Ranma"!?

00:45:07.690 --> 00:45:08.560
Ridiculous!

00:45:09.430 --> 00:45:13.230
I am the only man worthy of you.

00:45:18.600 --> 00:45:20.400
Ranma will be back!

00:45:20.810 --> 00:45:22.430
Back to settle the score
with you!

00:45:22.570 --> 00:45:25.240
Not to win you back?

00:45:26.510 --> 00:45:31.180
I don't care who comes.
I will not release you to anyone!

00:46:00.080 --> 00:46:04.610
Then I will fight with all my
strength... to win you.

00:46:05.520 --> 00:46:07.880
Ranma will win!
He will!

00:46:09.350 --> 00:46:12.950
The word "defeat" is
not in my dictionary.

00:46:13.930 --> 00:46:17.160
When I bring Ranma
to his knees once more...

00:46:17.300 --> 00:46:20.820
You will quietly accept your fate
and become my bride.

00:46:22.600 --> 00:46:23.360
All right.

00:46:26.940 --> 00:46:31.170
Prepare for a wedding ceremony
once we arrive at Nekonron!

00:46:53.770 --> 00:46:56.030
Old man!
Are we in Nekonron yet!?

00:46:56.300 --> 00:47:01.000
Yes! That mountain is their castle.
Seven-Luck Mountain!

00:47:08.350 --> 00:47:10.870
What the heck's that!?
Some kinda geyser?

00:47:13.950 --> 00:47:15.080
Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:47:15.150 --> 00:47:17.180
Hey, stop wiggling
the darned rope!

00:47:31.640 --> 00:47:32.630
Come.

00:47:41.350 --> 00:47:42.940
Oww!

00:47:43.420 --> 00:47:45.680
Man, this is a painful trip!

00:47:48.490 --> 00:47:50.250
There's a pagoda up there!

00:47:54.890 --> 00:47:58.230
That is the headquarters
of the Seven Lucky Gods!

00:47:58.300 --> 00:47:59.850
What?
Then Akane...

00:48:02.000 --> 00:48:02.990
W-What is that?!

00:48:03.070 --> 00:48:04.660
It's a stone they use
in their pickling vats...

00:48:04.740 --> 00:48:06.200
No, this thing!

00:48:07.210 --> 00:48:09.070
It's Akane and that jerk!

00:48:09.570 --> 00:48:11.570
Lychee, what's this say?

00:48:12.810 --> 00:48:14.680
Today at sundown
in the castle tower...

00:48:14.750 --> 00:48:19.620
Master Kirin and his fiancée
Akane will hold their reception.

00:48:19.750 --> 00:48:24.280
The Seven Lucky Gods await the
guests at the castle gates.

00:48:24.760 --> 00:48:27.820
That means this is a challenge!

00:48:28.760 --> 00:48:31.890
That pretty-boy jerk!
Thanks for the invite!

00:48:32.400 --> 00:48:33.730
Wait, Ranma!

00:48:37.370 --> 00:48:39.530
Go forth to battle, Ranma!

00:48:40.140 --> 00:48:43.010
Go, and test your strength!

00:48:43.170 --> 00:48:46.140
However, before you can
battle the leader...

00:48:46.280 --> 00:48:49.840
you must first defeat each of
the other Seven Lucky Gods!

00:48:50.680 --> 00:48:53.240
The Seven Lucky Gods?
That means...

00:48:55.950 --> 00:48:58.860
That means I can see
the pretty lady again!

00:49:08.570 --> 00:49:10.430
So the little man has come.

00:49:11.700 --> 00:49:14.230
With Bishamonten guarding
the first castle gate...

00:49:14.640 --> 00:49:16.540
you'll not get
through that easily!

00:49:18.480 --> 00:49:20.270
Why is the first one so big?

00:49:20.410 --> 00:49:22.310
Outta the way!
Outta the way!

00:49:24.550 --> 00:49:27.990
I'm coming to see the pretty lady
with the lute!

00:49:28.390 --> 00:49:30.510
Get in my way, and I'll...

00:49:45.800 --> 00:49:47.860
All right!
One down!

00:49:48.070 --> 00:49:48.940
Let's go!

00:49:50.240 --> 00:49:52.180
We're goin' on ahead, old man!

00:49:52.810 --> 00:49:55.610
P-Pretty l-lady...

00:49:59.350 --> 00:50:00.080
Second Castle Gate

00:50:00.150 --> 00:50:01.210
What the heck!?

00:50:07.230 --> 00:50:10.160
I guess this means
I should come on in. Right!

00:50:10.900 --> 00:50:12.190
W-Wait, Ranma!

00:50:24.310 --> 00:50:27.440
As the game plays on,
the sun sets...

00:50:28.580 --> 00:50:29.950
Is that your move?

00:50:31.250 --> 00:50:32.910
Are you two guys
the guards here?!

00:50:33.590 --> 00:50:36.650
Seems we have company,
Daihakusei.

00:50:36.920 --> 00:50:38.620
Seems we do,
Daikokusei.

00:50:39.790 --> 00:50:42.280
Sorry to interrupt your relaxing
game of Go...

00:50:42.430 --> 00:50:44.090
but I'm coming through.

00:50:44.930 --> 00:50:47.230
Did he make some noise?

00:50:47.900 --> 00:50:51.300
We're left with no choice
but to take him on.

00:50:52.600 --> 00:50:54.700
First move,
4-14, black!

00:50:59.310 --> 00:51:01.780
W-What!?
It's a giant Go stone!

00:51:02.310 --> 00:51:07.580
That's right. The castle gate
itself is a giant Go board.

00:51:07.750 --> 00:51:13.020
And as we play Go,
the stones will fall upon you!

00:51:13.930 --> 00:51:16.290
Second move,
4-13, white!

00:51:20.130 --> 00:51:21.960
First move,
6-16!

00:51:22.430 --> 00:51:23.730
Second move,
8-13!

00:51:33.080 --> 00:51:34.910
Man! They're outta control!

00:51:35.510 --> 00:51:38.070
That's right!
Run while you still can!

00:51:38.220 --> 00:51:41.850
And when you run out of places to go,
it's all over for you!

00:51:44.260 --> 00:51:46.090
Places to go?
I got it!

00:51:49.260 --> 00:51:51.460
Hey!
He's disappeared!

00:51:52.000 --> 00:51:54.620
You're right!
Where'd he go?

00:51:56.430 --> 00:51:59.300
Your attack has one fatal flaw!

00:52:00.070 --> 00:52:03.130
In Go, you can't place a stone
in the same place twice.

00:52:03.680 --> 00:52:06.140
You were talking about
having no place to go.

00:52:06.280 --> 00:52:09.010
But the top of the stones
makes a great place to go!

00:52:09.350 --> 00:52:13.750
The more stones you put down,
the more places I have to go!

00:52:14.220 --> 00:52:17.090
He's right!
What an oversight!

00:52:17.960 --> 00:52:18.750
Gotcha!

00:52:21.690 --> 00:52:24.660
That's it!
Once this is broken...

00:52:24.730 --> 00:52:27.390
W-What have you done!?

00:52:46.550 --> 00:52:48.080
That's two down!

00:52:58.030 --> 00:52:59.160
Is this it?

00:53:00.500 --> 00:53:02.300
No guard at this gate?

00:53:04.070 --> 00:53:06.800
Then I'll just let myself in.

00:53:14.380 --> 00:53:15.510
He's huge!

00:53:15.910 --> 00:53:18.110
He's bigger than my Jasmine!

00:53:24.520 --> 00:53:25.610
Jasmine?

00:53:44.410 --> 00:53:45.400
What the!

00:53:45.840 --> 00:53:47.570
Looks like they're friends now!

00:53:48.250 --> 00:53:50.910
G-Guess that means
the coast is clear.

00:53:51.050 --> 00:53:51.780
Let's go!

00:53:52.050 --> 00:53:54.420
Jasmine, stay and
keep him company awhile.

00:54:12.570 --> 00:54:14.400
How lovely you are!

00:54:33.930 --> 00:54:36.260
I got business with the guy
that's beyond this gate.

00:54:36.390 --> 00:54:39.190
If you don't wanna get hurt,
just let me through!

00:54:40.400 --> 00:54:44.490
Such bold words.
You're no match for me.

00:54:45.540 --> 00:54:48.200
Don't underestimate me!
You just come down here and...

00:54:51.940 --> 00:54:55.670
I am Monlon, guardian of
the fourth castle gate.

00:54:55.750 --> 00:54:59.550
I'm afraid I'm unable to
let you pass through here.

00:54:59.850 --> 00:55:04.750
Monlon Ultimate Technique:
The Phantom Restriction Attack!

00:55:11.530 --> 00:55:14.970
The more you struggle,
the tighter the wires become!

00:55:18.000 --> 00:55:21.870
Do you understand
my power!?

00:55:22.610 --> 00:55:25.630
Give up and go home, little boy.

00:55:26.940 --> 00:55:29.810
Then you can have your life.

00:55:30.720 --> 00:55:32.110
Gimme a break!

00:55:33.320 --> 00:55:36.120
I have to get
through that gate!

00:55:36.690 --> 00:55:39.180
I won't go back,
even if it kills me!

00:55:41.130 --> 00:55:44.790
I see. Then I have no choice.

00:55:45.460 --> 00:55:46.490
Die!

00:55:59.740 --> 00:56:01.140
What happened!?

00:56:04.050 --> 00:56:05.850
Ranma!
You all right?

00:56:06.320 --> 00:56:07.980
Sh-Shampoo!

00:56:09.250 --> 00:56:10.850
You don't know when to die!

00:56:10.920 --> 00:56:13.410
Monlon!
I defeat you!

00:56:15.560 --> 00:56:16.490
Shampoo!

00:56:16.630 --> 00:56:18.930
Ranma!
Take girl, and go!

00:56:19.200 --> 00:56:20.130
Thank you.

00:56:21.270 --> 00:56:21.730
Wait!

00:56:21.870 --> 00:56:22.490
Monlon!

00:56:22.830 --> 00:56:25.930
Shampoo your only opponent now!

00:56:26.700 --> 00:56:28.470
Very well, come!

00:56:35.180 --> 00:56:36.370
Sh-Shampoo!

00:56:36.510 --> 00:56:37.850
Let's go, Ranma!

00:56:48.260 --> 00:56:52.090
So you've made it all the way
to the fifth castle gate!

00:56:52.630 --> 00:56:56.460
But I will allow no one
to pass through here!

00:56:57.070 --> 00:56:58.760
I don't got time for this!

00:56:58.840 --> 00:57:01.130
If you won't let me through,
I'll knock you outta the way!

00:57:01.470 --> 00:57:02.340
Let's do it!

00:57:06.440 --> 00:57:07.310
Ranma!

00:57:09.810 --> 00:57:11.780
That didn't do nothin'!

00:57:12.450 --> 00:57:15.820
I hoped not! This wouldn't
be a fight otherwise.

00:57:15.890 --> 00:57:16.880
Here I come!

00:57:22.790 --> 00:57:26.960
Say it! "Ebiten,
stop it! Leave me alone!"

00:57:32.100 --> 00:57:37.340
You're nothing! How'd you get this far,
as bad as you are?

00:57:37.940 --> 00:57:40.140
Well, this is the end!

00:57:40.280 --> 00:57:42.110
Die!

00:57:46.480 --> 00:57:47.080
Who was that!?

00:57:48.250 --> 00:57:50.190
Ranma!

00:57:50.860 --> 00:57:53.220
Leave Akane to me!

00:57:53.960 --> 00:57:55.720
R-Ryoga!?

00:57:55.860 --> 00:57:59.090
W-Why, you!
None shall pass!

00:58:04.170 --> 00:58:05.400
What the!?

00:58:06.570 --> 00:58:08.440
Wherefore art thou,
Akane Tendo?

00:58:10.210 --> 00:58:13.370
H-How dare they step upon me!

00:58:18.080 --> 00:58:20.950
My little Akane!

00:58:21.090 --> 00:58:23.210
Brace up, Shampoo!
Your wounds are minor!

00:58:23.390 --> 00:58:25.150
Shampoo right here!

00:58:25.320 --> 00:58:26.810
Akane! Wait for me!

00:58:27.360 --> 00:58:29.020
I'm coming!

00:58:30.630 --> 00:58:33.650
How'd they get here?

00:58:34.330 --> 00:58:39.560
H-How dare they?
None shall p-pass...

00:58:46.140 --> 00:58:49.910
We are here to join these
two halves of the scroll.

00:58:51.580 --> 00:58:55.250
When it is done,
we two shall be one.

00:58:57.960 --> 00:59:00.080
Here, take this...

00:59:06.530 --> 00:59:09.160
It is time to exchange the vows.

00:59:17.580 --> 00:59:20.510
Why do you hesitate?
Come now...

00:59:24.520 --> 00:59:27.970
Aren't you coming for me, Ranma?

00:59:30.050 --> 00:59:31.020
Akane!

00:59:31.960 --> 00:59:32.850
Ryoga?

00:59:33.460 --> 00:59:33.860
Akane!

00:59:33.990 --> 00:59:34.860
Akane!

00:59:36.260 --> 00:59:40.860
Mr. Saotome!? And...
Y-You all came for me!

00:59:42.770 --> 00:59:45.030
Ranma!? Where's Ranma?!

00:59:45.170 --> 00:59:48.500
Brute! I'm taking
Akane out of here!

00:59:48.910 --> 00:59:54.670
What barbarians,
to interrupt a sacred ceremony.

00:59:55.750 --> 00:59:56.610
You will be punished!

00:59:59.280 --> 01:00:00.080
That's!

01:00:00.220 --> 01:00:01.080
Jeez!

01:00:09.030 --> 01:00:13.520
D-Dad! Mr. Saotome!
Ryoga!

01:00:14.000 --> 01:00:14.990
What is wrong?

01:00:15.430 --> 01:00:19.560
I've disposed of those meddlers,
but you're displeased.

01:00:20.000 --> 01:00:23.370
Who'd be pleased when their Dad
and friends get beaten up?

01:00:23.440 --> 01:00:25.810
Where is that pretty-boy jerk?!

01:00:32.120 --> 01:00:33.340
Ranma!

01:00:34.690 --> 01:00:38.550
I'm finally here!
Let's settle the score!

01:00:40.620 --> 01:00:42.560
You could
never defeat me!

01:00:42.690 --> 01:00:46.250
I'll never know 'til I try!
Let's go!

01:00:46.400 --> 01:00:48.960
Chestnuts Roastin' on
an Open Fire Attack!

01:00:54.840 --> 01:00:55.970
What the?!

01:00:56.110 --> 01:00:58.100
None of my punches
are gettin' through!

01:00:58.240 --> 01:01:00.800
I already know how
to counter your attack.

01:01:08.650 --> 01:01:09.620
Ranma!

01:01:12.790 --> 01:01:15.450
He countered my Chestnuts
Roastin' on an Open Fire!

01:01:15.760 --> 01:01:18.820
Has he got some
kinda invisible shield?!

01:01:20.500 --> 01:01:22.990
What're those?!
It feels like I've been pinched!

01:01:27.940 --> 01:01:29.000
That's it!

01:01:29.340 --> 01:01:33.830
That's no invisible shield!
He blocked me with his chopsticks!

01:01:34.280 --> 01:01:35.250
Stop it!

01:01:35.380 --> 01:01:39.110
Please, stop it!
If this goes on, Ranma will...

01:01:39.250 --> 01:01:40.220
Quit it!

01:01:40.650 --> 01:01:44.310
Girls shouldn't butt in
on a fight between men!

01:01:45.090 --> 01:01:49.150
W-What!? But you were losing!
I was just worried about you!

01:01:49.390 --> 01:01:55.160
You idiot! If I quit now,
how am I gonna get you back?!

01:01:57.270 --> 01:01:58.530
R-Ranma!

01:01:59.200 --> 01:02:02.100
He is correct.
Now stand back.

01:02:03.340 --> 01:02:06.280
I can't beat him with
normal attacks, so...

01:02:06.410 --> 01:02:10.310
Ranma, shall we
end this farce?

01:02:11.050 --> 01:02:13.810
Gotta hit him with somethin'
his chopsticks can't stop!

01:02:14.650 --> 01:02:18.280
I shall send you to the netherworld
with my attack.

01:02:18.960 --> 01:02:22.320
But what can't be
stopped by chopsticks?

01:02:24.700 --> 01:02:27.060
Sweat? That's it!

01:02:27.200 --> 01:02:28.560
Let us fight, Ranma!

01:02:28.700 --> 01:02:30.860
C'mon! I'm your man!

01:02:42.310 --> 01:02:43.840
Here I come!

01:02:49.320 --> 01:02:50.340
R-Ranma!?

01:02:50.520 --> 01:02:51.680
What's he doing?!

01:02:52.920 --> 01:02:55.480
You know you can't win.
Do you surrender?

01:02:57.190 --> 01:02:58.890
Not a chance.

01:03:00.060 --> 01:03:03.230
Here's where I break down
your iron defenses!

01:03:03.370 --> 01:03:04.360
What?

01:03:10.040 --> 01:03:11.200
I did it!

01:03:11.410 --> 01:03:14.670
Huh? That can't be
hot water gushing up...

01:03:14.980 --> 01:03:19.610
That's crazy! He used the last of
his energy to dig a hot spring?

01:03:29.290 --> 01:03:31.630
An interesting parlor trick.

01:03:31.760 --> 01:03:37.330
But I'd like to see how this
will help you break my defenses.

01:03:37.470 --> 01:03:41.500
Right, since you asked,
I'll show you!

01:03:42.170 --> 01:03:45.900
New and Improved Chestnuts
Roastin' on an Open Fire Attack!

01:03:47.040 --> 01:03:49.710
I do not see
how this is improved!

01:03:51.180 --> 01:03:51.910
What?!

01:03:52.880 --> 01:03:54.370
He got a body-blow in!

01:03:55.390 --> 01:03:57.510
I won't be defeated
by a chance hit!

01:04:00.190 --> 01:04:03.790
Impossible! The speed of his punches
is the same as before!

01:04:03.990 --> 01:04:04.860
Why?

01:04:05.660 --> 01:04:07.320
You look surprised!

01:04:09.000 --> 01:04:10.300
How about this!?

01:04:17.170 --> 01:04:17.940
That's it!

01:04:18.080 --> 01:04:21.700
Ranma used his Chestnuts
technique to hit him with water!

01:04:21.850 --> 01:04:26.750
Of course! The same as if one
tried to eat soup with chopsticks!

01:04:26.880 --> 01:04:30.910
Oho! Ranma! That's incredible!
You're so clever!

01:04:32.590 --> 01:04:36.550
Well, he is my son after all, Tendo!

01:04:37.330 --> 01:04:39.420
R-Ranma!

01:04:43.570 --> 01:04:46.260
I've never faced an opponent
such as you.

01:04:47.070 --> 01:04:50.870
I shall have to use
my full strength to fight you!

01:04:51.010 --> 01:04:54.380
For my honor as head
of the Seven Lucky Gods!

01:04:55.250 --> 01:04:59.080
Whatever happens,
I only have one move left!

01:04:59.150 --> 01:05:02.310
I have to risk all my remaining strength
on this one last punch!

01:05:18.470 --> 01:05:21.700
Secret Attack:
Hundred Chopstick Sting!

01:05:22.010 --> 01:05:24.910
Flyin' Dragon
Ascension Wave!

01:05:34.080 --> 01:05:35.480
W-What?!

01:05:43.060 --> 01:05:47.590
I-Impossible! I am Kirin,
the head of the Seven Lucky Gods!

01:05:47.730 --> 01:05:50.170
How can I lose to him?

01:05:50.530 --> 01:05:51.870
I did it!

01:05:58.510 --> 01:06:00.140
W-What the?!

01:06:13.020 --> 01:06:14.850
The scroll is over there!

01:06:17.530 --> 01:06:18.860
Akane!

01:06:19.600 --> 01:06:22.220
Damn! I can't swim near her!

01:06:25.170 --> 01:06:27.470
You jerk!
Give Akane back!

01:06:27.600 --> 01:06:31.230
That won't happen.
Akane will be my bride!

01:06:36.610 --> 01:06:37.600
The scroll!

01:06:57.470 --> 01:06:59.060
Akane!
Akane!

01:07:30.670 --> 01:07:32.660
Jeez, that was rough!

01:07:32.800 --> 01:07:35.100
Thank you for saving me, Ranma!

01:07:36.540 --> 01:07:38.170
Aw, it was nothin'.

01:08:02.330 --> 01:08:05.320
Here. You really care
about this scroll, right?

01:08:05.640 --> 01:08:06.900
Thank you.

01:08:41.470 --> 01:08:49.070
Thank you, Akane. You've given
me many new experiences.

01:08:49.450 --> 01:08:51.970
That's okay.
You don't need to thank me.

01:08:52.480 --> 01:08:57.280
Ranma, I've never met
your like before.

01:08:57.690 --> 01:08:59.250
You defeated me utterly.

01:09:00.690 --> 01:09:03.890
This means you're giving up
on marrying Akane, right?

01:09:04.030 --> 01:09:06.550
I chose to save the scroll
over Akane.

01:09:07.200 --> 01:09:10.960
You are the one who
saved her in the geyser.

01:09:11.740 --> 01:09:14.300
You are truly worthy of her.

01:09:19.740 --> 01:09:22.340
So, Lychee!
What're you gonna do now?

01:09:23.580 --> 01:09:25.510
Start from the beginning, again.

01:09:25.680 --> 01:09:28.710
I'll search for a true prince
on his white horse.

01:09:33.890 --> 01:09:37.160
By the way, what's written
on that scroll anyway?

01:09:39.500 --> 01:09:40.760
What's this?

01:09:41.330 --> 01:09:43.890
Seven Lucky God
Ultimate Technique...

01:09:44.030 --> 01:09:47.300
"How to Make Too-Too Delicious
Seven Lucky Pickled Vegetable!"

01:09:54.540 --> 01:09:57.640
This is first step for couple...

01:09:57.750 --> 01:10:01.450
to make a good marriage.

01:10:01.550 --> 01:10:07.250
First, groom wash vegetables,
then bride add salt, and press.

01:10:07.390 --> 01:10:10.190
Then both sprinkle
soy sauce together.

01:10:10.690 --> 01:10:13.600
Shampoo, you've got
such a cute voice!

01:10:13.660 --> 01:10:17.100
Hey, gramps! So what was
this "danger to the world"?

01:10:17.230 --> 01:10:19.460
What was this "sacrifice" talk?

01:10:19.600 --> 01:10:23.660
It may be ultimate! But it's the
ultimate way of making pickles!

01:10:25.180 --> 01:10:29.110
It's all right! Think of this
as a training trip!

01:10:29.350 --> 01:10:31.940
You call this...

01:10:32.250 --> 01:10:34.340
training!?

01:13:42.310 --> 01:13:44.600
About one month later...

01:13:44.710 --> 01:13:50.080
We received a photo and a vat
of Seven Lucky Pickled Veggies.

01:13:52.820 --> 01:13:53.750
Bingo!

01:13:55.320 --> 01:13:56.950
But, Saotome...

01:13:57.120 --> 01:14:02.150
While in China, shouldn't we
have visited the Cursed Springs?
